<title>ITALY: Fiat Comau 1H96 pre-tax profit falls.</title>
<headline>Fiat Comau 1H96 pre-tax profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit		 18.3  vs   23.5</p>
<p>    Cons turnover			  743.2  (up 23.6 pct)</p>
<p>    Operating profit			24.2  vs   37.6</p>
<p>Note - Comau Finanziaria Spa is a unit of Fiat Spa. It said the fall in profitability was due in the main to non-recurring operating income of nine billion lire which occurred in the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129450</p>
</text>
